{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "IMAP Spam Detection API",
    "description": "\nSpam detection and text summarization service of the Intelligent Message Analysis Platform (IMAP).\n\nThe API classifies batches of messages as `spam` or `not_spam`, returns classification\nprobabilities, provides information about the production model registered in MLflow and\naccepts feedback on individual predictions.\n\nFor each prediction, the application attempts to generate a short summary using Google\nGemini. If Gemini is unavailable or returns an unusable summary, it attempts the configured\ncloud summarization service. The query parameter `cloud=true` bypasses Gemini and selects\nthe cloud service directly. Classification can succeed even if summarization is unavailable;\nin that case `summary` is `null`.\n\n### Public deployment\n\nThe main API is publicly deployed at https://datatouille-api.onrender.com.\n\n### Security and privacy\n\n**Authentication is not enforced** by the current application. There is no application-level\nrate limiting. Avoid submitting sensitive or confidential information.\n\nEmail addresses and phone numbers are anonymized for classification and storage, but the\n**original unredacted message** is supplied to external summarization providers when summaries\nare requested. The public API should not be used for sensitive data without additional access\ncontrols and suitable data protection arrangements.\n\n### Storage and availability\n\nThe application stores predictions and feedback in SQLite for monitoring and future retraining.\nThe **Render free instance uses an ephemeral filesystem**, so this database is not durable:\ndata can be lost when the instance is restarted, redeployed or replaced. Use an external\ndatabase or a supported persistent disk if data retention is required.\n\nOn the free plan, the instance may also spin down when idle. A subsequent request can take\nlonger while FastAPI restarts and reloads the production model from MLflow.\n\nPrediction limits: 1 to 100 messages per request, each containing 1 to 10,000 characters and\nat least one non-whitespace character. The optional threshold is between 0.0 and 1.0\n(default 0.5).\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://datatouille-api.onrender.com",
      "description": "Public API hosted on Render"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "General"
        ],
        "summary": "Root",
        "description": "Return a welcome message with the name and the version of the API.",
        "operationId": "root__get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RootResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "General"
        ],
        "summary": "Health",
        "description": "Report whether the service is running and which model it serves.\n\nThe service is running whenever this endpoint answers. `model_loaded` tells whether\npredictions can be served.",
        "operationId": "health_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/model": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Model"
        ],
        "summary": "Model Info",
        "description": "Return the metadata of the model in production.\n\nThe response includes the registered name, alias and version of the model, the MLflow run\nthat produced it, and the cross-validation and test metrics recorded in that run.",
        "operationId": "model_info_model_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ModelInfoResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Production model not loaded"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected internal server error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/predict": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Prediction"
        ],
        "summary": "Predict",
        "description": "Classify between 1 and 100 messages and optionally summarize the original text.\n\nEach message contains 1 to 10,000 nonblank characters. The threshold is the minimum\nspam probability for the `spam` label and defaults to 0.5. The result order matches\nthe input order. `confidence` is the predicted label probability;\n`spam_probability` is the spam class probability regardless of the threshold.\n\n`cloud=false` (default) tries Gemini, then the configured cloud service if needed.\n`cloud=true` bypasses Gemini. Summarization failures do not prevent classification;\nthe result `summary` is then `null`. Summarization providers receive original text,\nnot anonymized input. The returned `prediction_id` can be sent to `/feedback`.",
        "operationId": "predict_predict_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "cloud",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "default": false,
              "title": "Cloud"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PredictionRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Predictions and optional summaries in the input order",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PredictionResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "model_name": "spam-classifier",
                  "model_version": "1",
                  "threshold": 0.5,
                  "predictions": [
                    {
                      "prediction_id": 1,
                      "label": "spam",
                      "confidence": 0.98,
                      "spam_probability": 0.98,
                      "summary": "A promotional message claims the recipient won a phone."
                    },
                    {
                      "prediction_id": 2,
                      "label": "not_spam",
                      "confidence": 0.97,
                      "spam_probability": 0.03
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid value detected while processing a request"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected internal server error"
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Production model or prediction storage is unavailable"
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/feedback": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Feedback"
        ],
        "summary": "Feedback",
        "description": "Store the label that the user considers correct for a prediction.\n\nThe prediction is identified by the `prediction_id` returned by `/predict`. Each prediction\naccepts one correction. The feedback is stored with a UTC timestamp and, together with the\nstored prediction, is used to monitor and retrain the model.",
        "operationId": "feedback_feedback_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FeedbackRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Feedback stored successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FeedbackResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": 1,
                  "prediction_id": 1,
                  "created_at": "2026-11-10T10:00:00+00:00",
                  "predicted_label": "not_spam",
                  "corrected_label": "spam",
                  "model_version": "1",
                  "message": "Feedback stored"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "The prediction does not exist"
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "The prediction already has feedback"
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Invalid feedback payload (for example, an unsupported label)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "invalid_label": {
                    "summary": "Unsupported corrected_label",
                    "value": {
                      "detail": [
                        {
                          "type": "literal_error",
                          "loc": [
                            "body",
                            "corrected_label"
                          ],
                          "msg": "Input should be 'spam' or 'not_spam'",
                          "input": "ham",
                          "ctx": {
                            "expected": "'spam' or 'not_spam'"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "missing_prediction_id": {
                    "summary": "Missing prediction_id",
                    "value": {
                      "detail": [
                        {
                          "type": "missing",
                          "loc": [
                            "body",
                            "prediction_id"
                          ],
                          "msg": "Field required",
                          "input": {
                            "corrected_label": "spam"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected internal server error"
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Prediction storage is unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "FeedbackRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "prediction_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1.0,
            "title": "Prediction Id",
            "description": "Identifier returned by /predict."
          },
          "corrected_label": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "spam",
              "not_spam"
            ],
            "title": "Corrected Label",
            "description": "Label that the user considers correct."
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "prediction_id",
          "corrected_label"
        ],
        "title": "FeedbackRequest",
        "description": "User correction of a prediction.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "corrected_label": "not_spam",
            "prediction_id": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "FeedbackResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Id"
          },
          "prediction_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Prediction Id"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Created At"
          },
          "predicted_label": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "spam",
              "not_spam"
            ],
            "title": "Predicted Label"
          },
          "corrected_label": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "spam",
              "not_spam"
            ],
            "title": "Corrected Label"
          },
          "model_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Model Version",
            "description": "Version of the model that made the prediction."
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "prediction_id",
          "created_at",
          "predicted_label",
          "corrected_label",
          "model_version",
          "message"
        ],
        "title": "FeedbackResponse",
        "description": "Confirmation of a stored feedback entry."
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Detail"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "HTTPValidationError"
      },
      "HealthResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "const": "ok",
            "title": "Status"
          },
          "model_loaded": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Model Loaded"
          },
          "model_name": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Model Name"
          },
          "model_version": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Model Version"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "status",
          "model_loaded",
          "model_name",
          "model_version"
        ],
        "title": "HealthResponse",
        "description": "Status of the service and of the loaded model."
      },
      "ModelInfoResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Name",
            "description": "Name of the model in the MLflow Model Registry."
          },
          "alias": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Alias",
            "description": "Alias through which the model was loaded."
          },
          "version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Version",
            "description": "Registered model version."
          },
          "run_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Run Id",
            "description": "MLflow run that produced the model."
          },
          "metrics": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "type": "object",
            "title": "Metrics",
            "description": "Cross-validation and test metrics."
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "alias",
          "version",
          "run_id",
          "metrics"
        ],
        "title": "ModelInfoResponse",
        "description": "Metadata of the production model."
      },
      "PredictionRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "texts": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 10000,
              "minLength": 1,
              "description": "Raw message to classify."
            },
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 100,
            "minItems": 1,
            "title": "Texts",
            "description": "Messages to classify, between 1 and 100 per request."
          },
          "threshold": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 1.0,
            "minimum": 0.0,
            "title": "Threshold",
            "description": "Spam probability from which a message is labelled as spam. A higher value produces fewer false positives and more false negatives.",
            "default": 0.5
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "texts"
        ],
        "title": "PredictionRequest",
        "description": "One or several messages to classify.",
        "examples": [
          {
            "texts": [
              "Congratulations! You won a FREE iPhone. Claim it at http://win.example",
              "Hi team, the meeting has been moved to 3pm. Write to ana@example.com"
            ],
            "threshold": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      "PredictionResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "model_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Model Name"
          },
          "model_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Model Version"
          },
          "threshold": {
            "type": "number",
            "title": "Threshold"
          },
          "predictions": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PredictionResult"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Predictions"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model_name",
          "model_version",
          "threshold",
          "predictions"
        ],
        "title": "PredictionResponse",
        "description": "Predictions for a batch of messages, in the order of the request."
      },
      "PredictionResult": {
        "properties": {
          "prediction_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Prediction Id",
            "description": "Identifier to send with /feedback."
          },
          "label": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "spam",
              "not_spam"
            ],
            "title": "Label",
            "description": "Predicted label."
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 1.0,
            "minimum": 0.0,
            "title": "Confidence",
            "description": "Probability of the predicted label."
          },
          "spam_probability": {
            "type": "number",
            "maximum": 1.0,
            "minimum": 0.0,
            "title": "Spam Probability",
            "description": "Probability of spam."
          },
          "summary": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Summary",
            "description": "Generated summary of the original message."
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "prediction_id",
          "label",
          "confidence",
          "spam_probability"
        ],
        "title": "PredictionResult",
        "description": "Prediction for one message."
      },
      "RootResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Name"
          },
          "version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Version"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "message",
          "name",
          "version"
        ],
        "title": "RootResponse",
        "description": "Welcome message of the API."
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "loc": {
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ]
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Location"
          },
          "msg": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Error Type"
          },
          "input": {
            "title": "Input"
          },
          "ctx": {
            "type": "object",
            "title": "Context"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "loc",
          "msg",
          "type"
        ],
        "title": "ValidationError"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "General",
      "description": "Service information and health check."
    },
    {
      "name": "Model",
      "description": "Metadata of the model in production."
    },
    {
      "name": "Prediction",
      "description": "Spam classification of messages."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Collection of user corrections."
    }
  ]
}
